# Keep local build output, dependencies and private files out of the image
# build. A fresh clone has none of them; a working copy does. The image needs
# no file or folder at the top level whose name starts with a dot.
.*
*.log
target
target-*
crates/vda-guard/fuzz/target
crates/vda-guard/fuzz/corpus
crates/vda-guard/fuzz/artifacts
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/screenshots
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
web/*.tsbuildinfo
